126	44f13bfd-4c0b-4193-9260-10492afb5915	\N	125	127	catalog-pg-ts-config.html	html	\N	\N	52.59.pg_ts_config#	\N	\N	\N	\N	52.59.pg_ts_config#	\N	\N	\N	\N	18	en	{"title": "52.59.pg_ts_config#", "filename": "catalog-pg-ts-config.html", "chunk_count": 1, "chunk_index": 0}	Page: 52.59.pg_ts_config#\nSource: catalog-pg-ts-config.html\n\n52.59.\npg_ts_config\n#\nThe\npg_ts_config\ncatalog contains entries representing text search configurations. A configuration specifies a particular text search parser and a list of dictionaries to use for each of the parser's output token types. The parser is shown in the\npg_ts_config\nentry, but the token-to-dictionary mapping is defined by subsidiary entries in\npg_ts_config_map\n.\nPostgreSQL\n's text search features are described at length in\nChapter 12\n.\nTable 52.59.\npg_ts_config\nColumns\nColumn Type\nDescription\noid\noid\nRow identifier\ncfgname\nname\nText search configuration name\ncfgnamespace\noid\n(references\npg_namespace\n.\noid\n)\nThe OID of the namespace that contains this configuration\ncfgowner\noid\n(references\npg_authid\n.\noid\n)\nOwner of the configuration\ncfgparser\noid\n(references\npg_ts_parser\n.\noid\n)\nThe OID of the text search parser for this configuration	486f986b5726fbc29674c15195cd67facb269ea9277ebffdea4f50672722f0d7	\N	0	1	bge-base-en-v1.5	[-0.63770485,1.4673649,-2.876128,-2.2096756,0.4213526,-0.727409,-0.1957288,0.6680308,-1.0010824,-0.8521216,0.106486425,-0.41569033,1.0953747,0.12807007,-0.46050924,-0.1794629,-0.26120427,0.2155505,-0.63749945,-0.22662884,0.032979365,-1.0109876,0.05315772,-0.19932817,1.52188,1.6128081,-0.13588795,0.19003803,-0.49328703,-0.21415241,0.4521707,-0.2258871,-0.1036995,0.27170086,-0.62043875,-0.74834305,0.87695044,-0.103888616,-1.141363,0.44489422,1.6155139,0.47250047,0.44540995,-1.4398512,0.56416893,-0.8254506,0.94275767,0.15581344,1.4219036,-1.5019962,-0.14123565,0.04088583,0.52557653,-0.5988194,0.37394407,0.3196947,0.26927918,-0.09183114,0.65390676,-0.8275521,1.385