272	77a46e9a-2288-4761-9ae5-343736713a05	\N	271	273	ecpg.html	html	\N	\N	Chapter 34.ECPG— EmbeddedSQLin C	\N	\N	\N	\N	Chapter 34.ECPG— EmbeddedSQLin C	\N	\N	\N	\N	18	en	{"title": "Chapter 34.ECPG— EmbeddedSQLin C", "filename": "ecpg.html", "chunk_count": 1, "chunk_index": 0}	Page: Chapter 34.ECPG— EmbeddedSQLin C\nSource: ecpg.html\n\nChapter 34.\nECPG\n— Embedded\nSQL\nin C\nThis chapter describes the embedded\nSQL\npackage for\nPostgreSQL\n. It was written by Linus Tolke (\n<\nlinus@epact.se\n>\n) and Michael Meskes (\n<\nmeskes@postgresql.org\n>\n). Originally it was written to work with\nC\n. It also works with\nC++\n, but it does not recognize all\nC++\nconstructs yet.\nThis documentation is quite incomplete. But since this interface is standardized, additional information can be found in many resources about SQL.	67ed0ec1942841ec31476934255be08a594d91004ae15cddb02c96f623505a94	\N	0	1	bge-base-en-v1.5	[0.16163391,0.8901974,-3.1788595,-1.54718,1.2107254,-0.7158669,0.30548608,-0.036725707,-1.0949743,-1.0939431,-0.47111136,-0.21151397,0.3733832,-0.010298411,0.17279097,0.33750287,0.105708696,-0.45178276,-0.5735428,1.4118257,-0.5301955,-0.11245948,-0.029165043,-0.06697675,2.6166902,0.33309263,0.48843518,-0.14404812,-0.818786,-0.02962063,-0.05595397,-0.7396392,0.0043740906,-0.301295,-1.0410401,-1.1986613,0.47797054,0.32258564,-1.069484,0.41459015,0.41658977,0.49100116,0.006603893,0.0061729844,0.15805922,0.7501901,0.673373,0.816599,1.7642715,-1.1519477,-0.0016302292,0.89473754,0.2194569,-0.7857375,0.8354978,0.8005001,0.4109243,1.0655923,0.33950162,-0.6239473,1.6269089,0.38399422,-0.90829706,0.7052103,1.1004561,-0.5430071,0.26698455,0.7543492,0.1729565,-1.3357286,0.2803245,-0.17746292,-0.13704363,0.5818084,-0.098256655,-0.87343675,0.54486126,-0.8484423,-0.06245123,0.57152534,0.105487436,-0.12754045,0.81036305,-0.74242204,0.74125123,-0.65159273,-0.81654596,-0.09865499,-0.8690735,0.2577457,0.17209405,-0.32387468,-0.65507174,0.612095,-1.5602642,0.48619524,0.26660797,0.694