 value that cannot be interpreted as a\nfloat\n. The library uses\nstrtod()\nfor this conversion. (SQLSTATE 42804)\n-207 (\nECPG_NUMERIC_FORMAT\n)\n#\nThe host variable is of type\nnumeric\nand the datum in the database is of another type and contains a value that cannot be interpreted as a\nnumeric\nvalue. (SQLSTATE 42804)\n-208 (\nECPG_INTERVAL_FORMAT\n)\n#\nThe host variable is of type\ninterval\nand the datum in the database is of another type and contains a value that cannot be interpreted as an\ninterval\nvalue. (SQLSTATE 42804)\n-209 (\nECPG_DATE_FORMAT\n)\n#\nThe host variable is of type\ndate\nand the datum in the database is of another type and contains a value that cannot be interpreted as a\ndate\nvalue. (SQLSTATE 42804)\n-210 (\nECPG_TIMESTAMP_FORMAT\n)\n#\nThe host variable is of type\ntimestamp	8771a255caf03377102c3d52d451ee25d9b7249357961858270ded9313eee918	\N	4	7	bge-base-en-v1.5	[1.1013771,1.4658232,-2.9912739,-1.7872245,1.6678011,0.10041438,0.46989727,0.5155433,-0.5757473,-0.71401906,-0.52196735,0.3076112,0.45397434,-0.14572485,0.38958403,-0.04940612,-0.059698872,-0.4442723,-0.4680331,0.73950756,-0.22120848,-0.2778147,-0.95566773,-0.056436475,1.4984251,1.0451807,-0.8916952,0.50760806,-1.0399674,0.7910175,0.43439105,0.06855297,0.90254426,-1.0953555,-0.64408445,-0.909457,-0.19822374,-0.52725345,-0.1749148,0.41823032,0.65342563,-0.094553865,0.626738,0.21320376,-0.7965166,-0.17119963,1.3208413,1.1021136,0.9368108,-0.9684207,0.56702864,-0.69925815,0.2528938,-0.81680137,1.3623581,0.5773133,-0.8777643,0.5276455,0.31136045,0.040218733,1.811393,-0.44946966,-0.18269457,0.9934755,0.83178645,0.09973961,-0.7196374,0.42892817,0.23959549,-0.8665635,0.4321321,0.06481101,-0.9008713,0.5704297,-0.4305594,-0.6841206,0.11902995,-0.7035882,-0.57617086,0.49050388,0.18657896,-0.06963654,0.7939488,-0.43067104,0.89779246,-0.042821966,-1.0583781,0.35189813,-0.24643905,0.4857081,0.12726538,0.057927713,0.28541028,0.647219,-1.0449108,0.19863014,0.31081858,1.0742753,-0.03668692