587	53e958e5-9376-4bd8-9e58-ada03ab2e5a0	\N	586	588	monitoring.html	html	\N	\N	Chapter 27. Monitoring Database Activity	\N	\N	\N	\N	Chapter 27. Monitoring Database Activity	\N	\N	\N	\N	18	en	{"title": "Chapter 27. Monitoring Database Activity", "filename": "monitoring.html", "chunk_count": 1, "chunk_index": 0}	Page: Chapter 27. Monitoring Database Activity\nSource: monitoring.html\n\nChapter 27. Monitoring Database Activity\nA database administrator frequently wonders,\n“\nWhat is the system doing right now?\n”\nThis chapter discusses how to find that out.\nSeveral tools are available for monitoring database activity and analyzing performance. Most of this chapter is devoted to describing\nPostgreSQL\n's cumulative statistics system, but one should not neglect regular Unix monitoring programs such as\nps\n,\ntop\n,\niostat\n, and\nvmstat\n. Also, once one has identified a poorly-performing query, further investigation might be needed using\nPostgreSQL\n's\nEXPLAIN\ncommand.\nSection 14.1\ndiscusses\nEXPLAIN\nand other methods for understanding the behavior of an individual query.	1a274ec2ab322941d9d37e04696d49ef1f0ad286c234d8dccdc8d3957815c273	\N	0	1	bge-base-en-v1.5	[-0.00044630884,0.5304152,-3.8023796,-0.4718086,1.1809738,-0.95038986,1.4637444,0.18681169,0.6190063,-1.1603881,0.2598652,0.48924118,1.3568499,0.21247725,-0.29043657,-1.0305063,-0.5165732,-1.2248465,-0.91663086,0.1648932,0.629897,-0.21693553,-0.82612324,-0.14873599,1.6684709,0.95549166,-0.52331656,0.70092064,0.09350726,0.46105134,0.03894251,0.53846437,-0.8867947,-0.4919431,-1.0770501,-0.43787658,0.3207584,0.23771583,-0.4562019,0.5467139,0.9791144,0.19849837,0.04805165,-1.7874074,0.051056407,0.15727125,0.100191385,0.6005132,1.2964301,-0.9735247,-0.31993288,-0.36882195,0.81138706,0.05817553,1.2562444,0.777666,-0.51663697,-0.2780932,0.04592244,-1.251751,2.7996204,-0.28354222,-0.5217817,0.7797272,0.11666656,-0.888196,-0.17115381,0.31577083,0.26977763,-0.9247418,0.61634415,0.018123869,-0.21713667,0.92400455,