25	how to configure vaccum	Configure `autovacuum` settings to manage vacuuming effectively:\n\n```sql\n-- Enable autovacuum (if not already enabled)\nALTER SYSTEM SET autovacuum = on;\n\n-- Adjust autovacuum parameters\nALTER SYSTEM SET autovacuum_naptime = 60; -- Time between autovacuum launcher checks\nALTER SYSTEM SET vacuum_freeze_age = '900000000'; -- Freeze age in transactions\n\n-- Set track_counts to true for autovacuuming\nALTER SYSTEM SET track_counts = on;\n\n-- Restart PostgreSQL to apply changes\nSELECT pg_reload_conf();\n```\n\nThese settings help manage vacuuming automatically, reducing manual intervention. Adjust `autovacuum_naptime` and `vacuum_freeze_age` based on your workload.	[0.19768375,0.76511765,-3.2904088,-0.69036317,1.4243567,0.24105081,-0.15140487,0.73675,-0.7071739,-1.0582681,-1.0060878,0.80063933,1.5076499,1.2265931,-0.025380196,0.7734244,-0.10728962,0.1379916,0.14530516,-1.3099424,-0.5626741,-0.74224776,-1.524479,-0.2516955,2.4521213,0.48611605,0.84857136,1.3223739,0.9389172,0.7077622,0.93678534,0.9221317,1.0471158,0.55131793,-0.31940523,-0.89656615,-0.017512094,-0.31185323,-0.7414865,-0.005777806,-0.87812334,-1.5557681,-0.047905818,-0.11845828,-0.5974304,0.31202438,0.73576945,-0.9525038,-0.335714,-1.4270045,0.3772834,-0.83584046,-1.4990035,-1.1405333,1.0140882,-0.30672857,0.8976652,-0.2186897,2.2279425,-0.41532108,1.4471499,0.12729952,0.5530237,1.8638787,0.20753759,0.55801415,-0.83446276,1.4307121,-0.65309536,-0.09563952,0.29071915,-0.82614213,1.0281838,-0.59609073,-0.24607006,0.14106697,-0.8045124,-1.175361,1.1656461,0.43843603,0.46374428,0.20203972,2.3479087,-0.21611948,1.3177747,-1.0855862,-0.6172333,-1.3902961,-0.52318406,-1.0216209,-0.6623392,0.57496715,-0.04022823,0.92459375,-0.18146497,1.0220774,-0.0446246,2.3010256,-0.27132323,-0.65964836,-0.57704204,0.8692873,-0.09739078,-0.054066565,-0.16473302,1.4325477,0.22813822,0.026087869,0.399358,-1.6007073,-1.4184968,0.27093264,-0.11310408,-0.80357844,0.38290432,-0.29245016,1.2811882,-