37	how can i change the 'locale' when initializing database cluster ?	To set a specific locale during `initdb` initialization, use the `--locale` option followed by the desired locale name (e.g., `fr_FR.UTF-8`). This sets both `LC_COLLATE` and `LC_CTYPE` to the specified values.\n\n```bash\ninitdb --locale fr_FR.UTF-8\n```\n\nThis ensures the database cluster uses the specified locale for sorting and comparing textual data.	[-0.32186735,-0.07496593,-2.957013,-0.5916937,0.5774155,-0.17552768,-0.05793316,1.5333445,-0.52319384,-0.66376376,-0.18266353,0.83218753,1.7668859,0.36317506,-0.19002686,-0.4846932,-1.392835,-0.5086169,0.4986311,0.61950123,-0.14687878,-0.48075747,-0.066508286,0.6075131,1.1145997,1.4890404,0.20442356,0.49145323,0.40362293,0.6452125,0.9831734,0.16755177,-0.1371206,-0.19472834,-0.34381536,0.042107597,-0.007741488,-0.18802306,-2.0152757,1.3331995,-0.14527024,-0.5504927,0.4195282,-1.470092,0.7421859,0.11737578,1.1819113,0.27684665,2.0068476,-0.15337932,-0.73455447,-0.09073122,0.1492434,-1.293677,0.321603,0.5595355,0.14649953,1.4602991,0.88020885,-0.84752715,1.521266,0.07348127,-0.09352974,1.6443298,-0.66122115,0.65753263,-0.8604226,1.5317736,-1.5067103,-0.6404356,0.4264332,1.591096,-0.07851457,0.2557289,-1.4202033,0.53601414,-0.86195344,-0.17940137,-0.33909547,0.6854356,0.03758963,1.90907,1.4827424,-0.92941403,0.64285004,1.5107636,0.047497503,-1.2473465,-0.40908697,0.14203751,0.51060015,0.7666172,-0.2189416,0.72139883,-0.89953476,-0.3837599,0.100551315,1.1601541,-0.5273404,0.093858175,-0.43478632,-0.9962912,-0.117066845,0.22735171,-0.35338488,0.052668236,-1.4226724,-0.40022054,-0.28758436,0.2945583,0.31159848,-0.20917092,0.7645803,0.17150936,-0.14576623,-0.26377746,1.6426833,-0.36857957,-0.1859079,-0.2869045,-0.1765708,-0.7867754,-0.47498876,0.298047,-0.01528937,0.09053684,-0.97234774,-0.25036973,0.66053396,-1.8835322,-1.1056198,-1.2559114,-0.35163778,1.6621622,-0.13296369,0.14707527,-0.13449506,-0.9959259,0.625875,0.5645899,-0.4277764,0.3894394,0.915