43	how to get primmary_conninfo ?	To retrieve `primary_conninfo` from a streaming replication slot, you can query the `pg_replication_slots` system view:\n\n```sql\nSELECT * FROM pg_replication_slots WHERE slot_name = 'your_slot_name';\n```\n\nThis will return details including `primary_conninfo`. Replace `'your_slot_name'` with the actual name of your replication slot.	[0.32480955,-0.0027705817,-2.990546,-1.1365421,-0.20330535,-0.87167823,-0.3523435,-0.38899678,-1.772733,0.40449926,-1.2353212,0.8817152,2.0260947,-0.1524243,0.5471061,-1.1016126,0.3841044,-1.051118,-0.14239264,0.79014754,-1.0027575,-0.33463818,0.26520097,0.9297127,2.1723464,0.64418495,0.9009111,0.5330759,-0.08671275,0.4102124,-0.5206001,-0.4428331,0.68467784,-0.48594624,-0.36383483,-0.994968,1.1041459,-0.52803516,-0.5005217,1.1052744,0.88522446,-0.92837346,0.6675878,-0.5410009,-0.4918445,-0.4245467,0.5003027,0.31435445,0.75663406,-1.2679257,0.64089054,1.5054389,0.79192895,-0.30199322,0.9959763,0.14861733,2.0578554,-0.12902819,0.6863296,0.21414337,2.0103202,0.4377306,0.19097097,2.2129722,0.5962082,-0.488929,-1.1217787,0.91123396,-0.8486192,0.4945758,-0.28636134,0.123279214,0.7319567,0.66180456,0.14253455,-0.7903113,-0.30468732,-1.6840575,0.33156252,-0.11092938,0.81293386,0.36939442,1.5580114,-0.74400425,0.8433816,0.7320942,-1.2424864,-0.8471778,-0.2255841,0.39269158,0.85143244,0.8780095,-0.039178636,0.7487539,-0.0799628,0.7961166,-0.18825552,0.4827892,-1.0461696,-0.84961945,-0.55952716,-0.39863613,0.47109598,0.35936835,-0.319918,0.43237004,-0.1000524,0.018914107,-0.45507747,0.0039629648,-1.9683783,0.69918907,-0.18754697,-0.053250592,0.98238426,-1.037792,0.07021875,-0.8229386,1.21456,0.8971071,-0.8817922,-1.1181037,0.13430849,1.7989156,-1.4222881,0.38990647,-0.80711836,0.07610678,0.91685987,-0.7541481,-0.73056793,-0.45988366,-0.08456528,-0.18541916,0.43579957,1.1235372,-0.7339103,-0.51569736,0.83863384,0.76180214,-0.41758662,-0.5266855,-0.29938382,-0.16211002,-0.55138177,-2.3086815,0.6318614,-0.1681603